    "value": "Partition candidate components and test group removal or retention of the complement under fixed equipment, deadline and other test conditions. Retain reductions that repeatedly reproduce failure, using the same predeclared repetition rule and treating inconsistent or uncertain outcomes as unresolved. The described signal is a smaller configuration that repeatedly remains late while specified further removals cease to reproduce lateness.",
